WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Want to build a leaner, stronger body, but unsure where to begin?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Meet AI4薄肌, your personal training companion powered by Codex.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Start with your time, equipment and training days. Build your own profile.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
How did you sleep? How is your energy? Let today’s state guide the plan.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Exercises, sets, rest and the reasons behind your plan, all in one place.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Record what you actually did. Correct it when needed. Keep progress grounded.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep your preferences and long-term memory. Pick up where you left off.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
See your efforts add up through calendars, charts and reflections.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Open the project. Tell Codex how you feel today. Make the next step concrete.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
AI4薄肌 is open source. Start today, and find your own pace.
